{"seq":2,"slug":"grid-mastery","title":"Grid 精通","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/css-and-visual-engineering/layout-systems/grid-mastery","wordCount":558,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"grid-精通\">Grid 精通</h1><h2 id=\"问题背景\">问题背景</h2><p>CSS Grid 是原生的<strong>二维</strong>布局系统，可以同时控制行和列。它与 Flexbox 互补——Flexbox 擅长一维排列，Grid 擅长二维网格。从仪表盘、图片画廊到整个页面骨架，Grid 都能优雅地实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Grid 同时定义行与列的<strong>轨道</strong>（track），通过 <code>grid-template-*</code> 声明网格骨架，再用 <code>grid-column</code>/<code>grid-row</code> 把子项放到指定单元格或区域；<code>fr</code> 单位与 <code>minmax()</code>/<code>repeat(auto-fit, …)</code> 让网格能按可用空间自适应分配，这正是它与 Flexbox 一维模型最本质的区别。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;Grid 容器&quot;&#10;        direction TB&#10;        R1[&quot;header(跨两列)&quot;]&#10;        R2A[&quot;sidebar&quot;] ~~~ R2B[&quot;main&quot;]&#10;        R3[&quot;footer(跨两列)&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph \"Grid 容器\"\n        direction TB\n        R1[\"header(跨两列)\"]\n        R2A[\"sidebar\"] ~~~ R2B[\"main\"]\n        R3[\"footer(跨两列)\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"grid-template-基础\">grid-template 基础</h2><h3 id=\"定义列和行\">定义列和行</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".grid {&#10;  display: grid;&#10;  grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr 1fr; /* 三列：固定 + 两个弹性 */&#10;  grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto; /* 三行 */&#10;  gap: 16px;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.grid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">grid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-template-columns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fr</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 三列：固定 + 两个弹性 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-template-rows</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auto</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fr</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 三行 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  gap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"fr-单位\">fr 单位</h3><p><code>fr</code>（fraction）表示剩余空间的份数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".grid {&#10;  display: grid;&#10;  grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr 1fr;&#10;  /* 总 4fr：第一列 25%，第二列 50%，第三列 25% */&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.grid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">grid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-template-columns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fr</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fr</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 总 4fr：第一列 25%，第二列 50%，第三列 25% */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>单位</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>px</code></td>\n<td>固定像素</td>\n<td><code>200px</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fr</code></td>\n<td>剩余空间份数</td>\n<td><code>1fr 2fr</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>%</code></td>\n<td>容器百分比</td>\n<td><code>50%</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>auto</code></td>\n<td>由内容决定</td>\n<td><code>auto</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>min-content</code></td>\n<td>最小内容宽度</td>\n<td>不换行最窄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max-content</code></td>\n<td>最大内容宽度</td>\n<td>不换行最宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>minmax()</code></td>\n<td>最小到最大范围</td>\n<td><code>minmax(200px, 1fr)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"命名区域\">命名区域</h2><p><code>grid-template-areas</code> 用 ASCII 字符画定义布局，极其直观：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".layout {&#10;  display: grid;&#10;  grid-template-areas:&#10;    &#39;header  header&#39;&#10;    &#39;sidebar main&#39;&#10;    &#39;footer  footer&#39;;&#10;  grid-template-columns: 250px 1fr;&#10;  grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;&#10;  min-height: 100vh;&#10;}&#10;&#10;.header {&#10;  grid-area: header;&#10;}&#10;.sidebar {&#10;  grid-area: sidebar;&#10;}&#10;.main {&#10;  grid-area: main;&#10;}&#10;.footer {&#10;  grid-area: footer;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.layout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">grid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-template-areas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'header  header'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'sidebar main'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'footer  footer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-template-columns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">250</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-template-rows</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auto</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fr</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  min-height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">vh</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-area</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: header;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.sidebar</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-area</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: sidebar;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-area</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: main;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.footer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-area</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: footer;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>.</code> 表示空单元格：<code>grid-template-areas: &quot;sidebar . main&quot;;</code></p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"auto-fill-与-auto-fit\">auto-fill 与 auto-fit</h2><p>实现响应式网格的利器，无需媒体查询：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* auto-fill：尽可能多地放列，空列保留 */&#10;.grid-fill {&#10;  display: grid;&#10;  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr));&#10;  gap: 16px;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* auto-fit：尽可能多地放列，空列折叠为 0 */&#10;.grid-fit {&#10;  display: grid;&#10;  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));&#10;  gap: 16px;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* auto-fill：尽可能多地放列，空列保留 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.grid-fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">grid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-template-columns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">repeat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auto-fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">minmax</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">250</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  gap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* auto-fit：尽可能多地放列，空列折叠为 0 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.grid-fit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark: