k:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">vh</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"grid-与-flexbox-选择\">Grid 与 Flexbox 选择</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Grid</th>\n<th>Flexbox</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>布局维度</td>\n<td>二维（行+列）</td>\n<td>一维（行或列）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容驱动 vs 布局驱动</td>\n<td>布局驱动</td>\n<td>内容驱动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对齐控制</td>\n<td>行列同时对齐</td>\n<td>单轴对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>页面骨架、仪表盘、画廊</td>\n<td>导航栏、卡片内容、工具栏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组合使用</td>\n<td>Grid 做整体布局，Flexbox 做局部排列</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"实用属性速查\">实用属性速查</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".item {&#10;  grid-column: 1 / 3; /* 从第1线到第3线（跨两列） */&#10;  grid-column: span 2; /* 跨两列 */&#10;  grid-row: 2 / -1; /* 从第2行线到最后一条线 */&#10;  justify-self: center; /* 单元格内水平居中 */&#10;  align-self: end; /* 单元格内底部对齐 */&#10;}&#10;&#10;.container {&#10;  justify-items: center; /* 所有项水平居中 */&#10;  align-items: center; /* 所有项垂直居中 */&#10;  place-items: center; /* 上两者的简写 */&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-column</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> / </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 从第1线到第3线（跨两列） */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-column</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: span </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 跨两列 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-row</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> / </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 从第2行线到最后一条线 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  justify-self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">center</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 单元格内水平居中 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  align-self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 单元格内底部对齐 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  justify-items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">center</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 所有项水平居中 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  align-items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">center</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 所有项垂直居中 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  place-items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">center</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 上两者的简写 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CSS Grid 是<strong>二维</strong>布局系统，同时控制行和列</li>\n<li><strong><code>fr</code></strong> 单位按比例分配剩余空间，是 Grid 最核心的单位</li>\n<li><strong>命名区域</strong>（<code>grid-template-areas</code>）让布局意图一目了然</li>\n<li><strong><code>auto-fill</code>/<code>auto-fit</code></strong> + <code>minmax()</code> 实现无媒体查询的响应式网格</li>\n<li><strong>Subgrid</strong> 让嵌套网格继承父级轨道，保持跨卡片对齐</li>\n<li>Grid 做页面骨架，Flexbox 做组件内部排列，二者配合使用效果最佳</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Grid 精通","id":"grid-精通"},{"level":2,"text":"问题背景","id":"问题背景"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"grid-template 基础","id":"grid-template-基础"},{"level":3,"text":"定义列和行","id":"定义列和行"},{"level":3,"text":"fr 单位","id":"fr-单位"},{"level":2,"text":"命名区域","id":"命名区域"},{"level":2,"text":"auto-fill 与 auto-fit","id":"auto-fill-与-auto-fit"},{"level":2,"text":"Subgrid","id":"subgrid"},{"level":2,"text":"响应式布局模式","id":"响应式布